The specific failures are:
1. "Mark all as completed" - `cy.eq()` failing after toggling the toggle-all checkbox
2. "Mark all as completed" - same for clearing the complete state
3. "Item" - `cy.find()` failing when marking items complete
4. "Item" - `cy.find()` failing when un-marking items complete

