Author: Sim Operator <sim@example.test>
Date:   Fri Jul 31 16:10:02 2026 +0000

    js/app.js: replace per-item event binding with event delegation

    Replaced bindItemEvents() with event delegation on  for
    toggle, destroy, and edit actions. This prevents DOM elements from
    detaching after re-render (innerHTML replaces the entire list),
    fixing the Cypress 'element detached from DOM' errors in the
    acceptance suite for mark-all, mark-item, unmark-item, and
    clear-completed operations.

